{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1000_038chz", "source_sha256": "17c2e90a9e1424d311e8a15008eb914f75a8967b0c371b2520ffb388aa97311d", "ja": "ごめんなさい、お待たせしてしまいましたわ。\nミーティングは始まっていまして？", "zh": "抱歉，让你们久等了。\n会议已经开始了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "696c7a7a89daa20f6b840a0e625f64d1c5ede95eed2140de6ba530eb9b292b50", "ja": "あら、ふたりともお疲れさま。大丈夫、今まで\n育ちゃんたちに以前の映像を見てもらっていたの。", "zh": "哎呀，你们两个都辛苦了。没关系，我刚才一直在让育她们看以前的影像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "94d75781c9a3d04bd49c93b8d48b5cd9b6b56864ef7d8523e083848e3f27138e", "ja": "今度のあずささんの曲のステージ、みたことある？\nすごいんだよ！", "zh": "你看过这次梓姐那首歌的舞台吗？特别厉害哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "468756a031b16de2ed35c4ec1cd3394453bca502a79ebfe15dcef05cc93552f6", "ja": "『Mythmaker』だよね。カッコよくてボクも大好き\nなんだ。くーっ、また見られるなんて嬉しいなぁ！", "zh": "是《Mythmaker》对吧。特别帅气，我也超级\n喜欢的。呜～，又能看到真是太让人高兴了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "399a880e5407e55a2e3927474cd30c66643edf014f076e1c107e5a2fcb9105d5", "ja": "そういえば……『Mythmaker』って、\nどういう意味なの？", "zh": "说起来……『Mythmaker』，\n是什么意思呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "feeea2015cd6ed1b19f8dcee96fa02ed357ce278816208eed587d011ea89d0f2", "ja": "『神話や伝説を創る人』っていう意味なんですって。\nふふっ、申し訳ないくらい素敵な意味よね。", "zh": "听说是“创造神话与传说的人”的意思。\n呵呵，含义美好得都让我觉得不好意思了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "76f49cc4cfe7391caeb6ba970bece55d4b4d0b46a0f1a23c14939e0e40242f23", "ja": "わたくしも先日映像を拝見して感銘を受けましたの。\n今度の公演、サポートとして気合いが入りますわね！", "zh": "我也在日前看过了影像，深受触动呢。\n面对接下来的公演，作为助演人员也更有干劲了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "1c112cd026ec8c3007a4e56be96c20d5878d8075ffebba63b5cf29c03811fb19", "ja": "それにしてもあずささん、最近絶好調じゃないですか？\nこの間のドラマも評判よかったし、CMも好調だし。", "zh": "话说回来，秋月小姐最近状态不是特别好吗？\n前段时间的电视剧反响也很好，广告拍得也很顺利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "6a20142f04fc28dce25819710624e581f4df41acb3881c8d64b4afdcef51dafd", "ja": "グラビアも話題になって、\nまた新しい話が来てるんですよね？", "zh": "写真杂志的拍摄也成了话题，\n而且又有新的工作找上门了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "38d1b92aadb14a91d5444c4b93bfd04f29465918b06459a3566c803c2752ae79", "ja": "それは、たまたまタイミングとかもよくて……\nいいご縁に恵まれたからだと思うわ。", "zh": "我想，是因为时机碰巧也很好……\n而且也遇到了很好的缘分吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "8b49f65eb4d650d50c644b08d5324dc82f5c8f515c3c27a6f0d454a35cbc003c", "ja": "あずささん、ごえんにめぐまれてるの？　じゃあ、\n『うんめいの人』とももうすぐ会えるかもしれないね！", "zh": "あずさ姐姐，你是遇到了很好的缘分吗？那样的话，说不定很快就能见到“命中注定的人”了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "269d04ab9bfb89610756030b08f86006a9767065f027a3e579a8c3ee70ebbb01", "ja": "あら。育、それはなんですの？", "zh": "哎呀。育，那是什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "4f583f8be8f3f57e112b550bcbca157f96afb8840ca6a2363c551b81d5468e94", "ja": "この前、あずささんに占いをしてもらったの。\nその時、お手本で先にあずささんを占ったんだけど……", "zh": "前些天，あずさ姐姐帮我算了命。  \n那时候，为了示范，我先给あずさ姐姐算了一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "6d26cc72ea0878dff4824cf893c3a2549310025f94e2ea9ed51f6deb00d69bfb", "ja": "やさしくてすてきで、あずささんを大切にしてくれる\n『うんめいの人』に会えるって出たんだよ！", "zh": "结果显示会遇到既温柔又优秀，\n而且还很珍惜梓小姐的“真命天子”哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "7293005fb2f7313b740ad9bb9e385a20685dc97944f0b643e534437e751cc386", "ja": "おおっと、いつどこで？\nあずさちゃん、心当たりあるの？", "zh": "哎呀，什么时候、在哪里？  \n梓小姐，你有没有想到什么人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "7678c13429baeed9e86a9610bc9dcab6c9e1cc6f0fc378f466ecba9066f85e2e", "ja": "う～ん……、どうかしら……？", "zh": "嗯～……我也不太确定……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1016_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1017_p", "source_sha256": "823130683d5c7900d4601923a73a0b19c2766f1695aa62fcbb2062c6a5fbaf1d", "ja": "あずささん、すみません。", "zh": "梓小姐，对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "4dee9ece0df83b1ec829f1cfdd52e635df6891d130f295abe47a82af430baaff", "ja": "あっ……{$P$}さん？", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "61f6349eb4137220e2016f53ab3fab1389edac124ed3784217a9b0b152179584", "ja": "まあ、{$P$}……。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1020_p", "source_sha256": "d089085ee902fd6c40f8d2d57d1098d20bc2f6c15dd3d913e9b833f957c04b8f", "ja": "ミーティング前に申し訳ないんですが相談が……\nあれ？　どうかしましたか？", "zh": "不好意思，会议前有件事想商量一下……\n咦？怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "c832858b520b60fe38f6ce29fd335be243e8d56893e78838e047e30c65493125", "ja": "いえ、なんでもないんです。\n相談って、公演のことでしょうか？", "zh": "不，没什么。\n您说的商量，是关于公演的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1022_p", "source_sha256": "cde16bf8d1151a4dc2bcd05da07827ad3090a07e88b001584ad7da0980c5aa8f", "ja": "いえ、別件で、あずささんに連ドラのオファーが来そう\nなんです。恋愛物で、主人公の恋人役なんですけど……", "zh": "不，是另一件事，好像有部连续剧想邀请梓小姐出演。\n是一部恋爱剧，演的是主角的恋人，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1023_p", "source_sha256": "914f321cab9052aebb7ff349d8783cdc3ee5e3b436f59abf5f2c40152408a9e9", "ja": "soumaっていう若手俳優、知ってますか？", "zh": "知道一位叫souma的年轻演员吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "7c171859a2c248fffd65ac1e4ecb5c1672d597bbf616c1aa878553eafcc767ab", "ja": "え、soumaって今人気急上昇中の？　イケメンで背が\n高くて爽やかで、CMにも引っ張りだこのsoumaくん？", "zh": "咦，你是说那个最近人气急升的souma？长得帅、个子高、气质清爽，还频繁受邀出演广告的souma？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1025_p", "source_sha256": "caa77c169dc3dea8637e76cfe05db9917f4fbcaeccf483915a68d5e1eac39a6f", "ja": "そう。そのsoumaさんが主演なんだけど……\n相手役にぜひあずささんをと打診してきていて。", "zh": "对。souma是主演……还特意来询问，希望由梓小姐出演他的对手戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "94c93d0b4a4496c09b14af7ff71bf2ee0766cb4b476e4a32105361057ac4e5ec", "ja": "なるほど……恋人にしたいナンバーワンの人気俳優から\nこのタイミングで恋人役にご指名とは……！", "zh": "原来如此……竟然在这个时候，被那位“最想交往的对象”排名第一的人气演员钦点出演恋人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1027_038chz", "source_sha256": "f41af646f5b94abd84da681c1421e3dbb38f7c4f42cdf695ed2f566f2a6b9d65", "ja": "あの、{$P$}？\n恋人役というのは、その……どの程度の？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}？\n恋人角色是指，那个……到什么程度的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1028_p", "source_sha256": "f90ef65775e7c8d99dc80bfafaf9895a80d6c647de973488a9b9d6abe63a3673", "ja": "ああ、絡みとかの意味でしたら、\n基本的に大丈夫そうです。", "zh": "啊，如果您说的是互动之类的，基本上应该没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1029_p", "source_sha256": "ef1fa129accdf434cd0c5fbc507e36beac31f8d07ce16b713eaf8cd2c7272364", "ja": "地上波のハートフル路線で、刺激の強いシーンは\n今のところ予定してないと聞いているので。", "zh": "说是走地上波的温情路线，目前并没有\n安排什么刺激性强烈的戏份。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1030_p", "source_sha256": "1fea3aba9d4ed81bca6c015bedea729221a9b55646c34d6ce716cc72d9f9c6ea", "ja": "幅広い世代に見てもらえますし、悪くない話だと\n思うんですが……あずささん、どうでしょう？", "zh": "各年龄段的人都能看到，我觉得是个不错的工作……\n梓小姐，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1031_010azu", "source_sha256": "4898120aa73bfd4b9ce1c675d04ced9f61443fdf07456201fe2b87489b6968c8", "ja": "そうですね……{$P$}さんが\nお仕事としてすすめてくださるなら。", "zh": "是啊……如果{$P$}先生愿意把这当作工作来推荐的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "9af67bd02395f53d51ece15ad71c4e8ebc530e6bbfc715401a675c0512995a74", "ja": "はい、お受けします。", "zh": "好的，我接受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1033_030iku", "source_sha256": "baba0b9cfb3dec95284b35c0e2779892c0c805106deaec631b63e7541394bfe4", "ja": "すごーい！　わたし、放送されたら\nおかあさんといっしょにぜったいみるね！", "zh": "好厉害！　播出以后，\n我一定会和妈妈一起看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1034_023aka", "source_sha256": "aa1146e9d01cdf46dc0673de14e6418bcb911e27537544fbf551abe91d9491da", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}ちゃん。\nそのドラマ、他の配役は決まってるのかな？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。那部电视剧的其他角色也都定下来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1035_023aka", "source_sha256": "cee44c158d8703cd1b73303de6bb8edf37424caa4be0c911dc932541d15719bb", "ja": "主人公の幼馴染とか妹とか～。ピッタリな美少女がいる\nって売り込むことも事務所的に必要だよね？", "zh": "像是主人公的青梅竹马啦、妹妹啦～。向剧组推销说有非常合适的美少女，这对事务所来说也是必要的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_154_1036_p", "source_sha256": "0df1a438493b91e64d39641c2117dbed14c0399473ed93bf0e0cf69ebd5ecadb", "ja": "そ、そうだな。それはそれで……。\nそれじゃあずささん、話を進めますね。", "zh": "是、是啊。那样也确实……\n那么，梓小姐，我们继续谈吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
